# Declared factual interface
> Using Integer_en as Integer
> Using Decimal_en as Decimal
> Using Date_en as Date
> Using List_en as List
```catala
declaration structure Meta:
  data s content integer
  data c content integer
  data refs content list of integer

declaration structure B0:
  data s content integer
  data c content integer
  data refs content list of integer
  data v content boolean

declaration structure B1:
  data s content integer
  data c content integer
  data refs content list of integer
  data v content decimal

declaration structure B2:
  data s content integer
  data c content integer
  data refs content list of integer
  data v content integer

declaration structure B3:
  data s content integer
  data c content integer
  data refs content list of integer
  data v content integer

declaration scope SharedRule:
  input f0 content B0
  input f1 content B0
  input f2 content B0
  input f3 content B3
  input f4 content B1
  output r0 content B3
  output r1 content B3
  output r2 content B3
  output r3 content B2
  output r4 content B2
  output r5 content B2
  output r6 content B2
  output r7 content B2
  output r8 content B0
  output r9 content B0
  output r10 content B2
  output r11 content B1
  output r12 content B2
  output r13 content B2
  output r14 content B2
  output r15 content B0
  output r16 content B3
  output r17 content B2
```

